Clean-room re-creation (ADR-021 §3, §4)
---------------------------------------

This cartridge is an original MADFAM work. It was authored clean-room: from a
recorded specification of the case's functional interfaces only, without access
to the implementation that previously occupied this slug, to that
implementation's git history, or to the third-party design whose files that
implementation vendored.

The prior cartridge vendored an upstream design licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. That
licence covers the design itself, not only its source, so reproducing the shape
from any source would carry the licence forward. Nothing from it is vendored,
copied, adapted or reproduced here, and the non-commercial restriction that
applied to the prior cartridge does not apply to this one.

Interface, not shape
--------------------

Per ADR-021 §4 the re-creation target is the INTERFACE — the functional
dimensions another part mates to — with a FORM of our own:

  Held (interface). The payload envelope; the seal — gasket ring inset 1.75 mm
  per side from the shell face, 2.0 mm ring width, 2.2 mm default depth over a
  1–5 mm range; the lid engagement rim, 3.0 mm deep with 0.5 mm assembly
  clearance; the knuckle hinge — 4.0 mm base radius against a 3.5 mm lid radius
  for 0.5 mm running clearance, and a lid knuckle 1 mm narrower axially; the
  latch catch — 25 mm wide, 5 mm engagement, 4 mm strap thickness; the 3 mm
  stacking foot height. A lid, a gasket or a latch printed from this cartridge
  interchanges with one printed from any other implementation of the same
  published interface.

  Ours (form). The shell silhouette — a belt rib running the seam line right
  around both halves and a corner pilaster at each vertical edge, so the case
  lands on its corners; the wall treatment; the waisted latch strap with its
  thumb ramp; the stadium-shaped foot pads. These are MADFAM design decisions
  and are deliberately unlike the prior cartridge's plain chamfered box, flat
  rectangular strap and flat rectangular pads.

The interface dimensions this cartridge implements are published in
docs/CLEANROOM-VERIFICATION.md alongside the measurements proving conformance.

No third-party code or design files are vendored in this cartridge.
